{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e554d060abb54c9e891ca8d6ee99331b/snapshots/215106189e0d43389abc7ff50ecaa9cb-00007.jpg\"/><p>本年度中國全國生態日，主題為「為中國現代化奠定綠色基礎」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8494442_中國生態規劃 保育修復並行 - 截图1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e554d060abb54c9e891ca8d6ee99331b/snapshots/215106189e0d43389abc7ff50ecaa9cb-00001.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>在2026年「十四五」期間，全國完成歷史遺留礦山修復治理面積335萬畝，超額完成目標任務19.6%。全國已建成1,000餘家國家級、4,500餘家省級綠色礦山。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8494442_中國生態規劃 保育修復並行 - 截图6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-vod-cdn.tvb.com/e554d060abb54c9e891ca8d6ee99331b/snapshots/215106189e0d43389abc7ff50ecaa9cb-00006.jpg\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新修訂的礦產資源法首次在法律層面，明確了綠色礦山建設要求。當局持續推動礦區生態環境改善，有效提升資源綜合利用水平，有序推動礦業綠色轉型。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:43:53.481715+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":179,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:35.922819+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T00:37:17.451038+00:00","content_hash":"e4ccc3b47bb6c11c214230d5ef66be2e51090a724ef4e14bcd5c09802f1d76f2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T00:43:53.481715+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}